From: INMYS <support@inmys.ru>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: rtc: pcf8523: describe disabled battery switchover

Document VDD-only operation for boards where enabling automatic battery
switching would disable the I2C interface during normal operation.

Signed-off-by: INMYS <support@inmys.ru>
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/rtc/nxp,pcf8523.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/rtc/nxp,pcf8523.yaml
@@ -25,6 +25,15 @@
     enum: [ 7000, 12500 ]
     default: 12500
 
+  nxp,disable-battery-switchover:
+    type: boolean
+    description:
+      Keep battery switch-over disabled and use VDD only. Needed on boards
+      where VBAT can exceed VDD during normal operation, making automatic
+      switching disable the I2C interface. Probe selects PM=010 and rejects
+      userspace requests to enable standard or direct battery switching.
+      Battery-backed timekeeping is unavailable in this mode.
+
 required:
   - compatible
   - reg
